I've been a new horrible blocker for four weeks. Not sure if all the work I have done the last

00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:35,240
month with these changes needs more time to work. What are your thoughts? I don't know the data

00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:46,240
and how fast these new medications may work and how fast if they are working. It's going to change the alkaline phosphatase.

