and but not AST. There's also an indicator of a metastatic bony lytic destruction of bone.

00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:24,240
So, if the AST went up this time, it can be an indication and can tie with the alkaline phosphatase

00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:31,240
and the phosphatase can be an indication just because of what the chemo might be negatively affecting the liver.

00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:36,240
And that's part of what you kind of have to go through if you're going to try a new chemo drug.

00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:45,240
I would consider increasing your coffee enemas, increasing duede castorial packs over the liver.

