00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:08,240
Make sure you drink your plenty of water. It's a really important thing during the summer months.

00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:13,240
We don't want to be suffering from ill effects, dehydration.

00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:18,240
And, you know, I think it's, you know, and that could be a major thing.

00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:23,240
